{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_241_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，鄭罕達帥師取宋師於嵒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"取，易辭也。以師而易取，宋病矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"二、夏，許男成卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"三、公會晉侯及吳子於黃池。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"黃池之會，吳子進乎哉！遂子矣。吳，夷狄之國也，祝髮文身，欲因魯之禮，因晉之權，而請冠、端而襲。其藉於成周，以尊天王，吳進矣。吳，東方之大國也，累累致小國以會諸侯，以合乎中國。吳能為之，則不臣乎，吳進矣。王，尊稱也。子，卑稱也。辭尊稱而居卑稱，以會乎諸侯，以尊天王。吳王夫差曰：「好冠來。」孔子曰：「大矣哉！夫差未能言冠而欲冠也。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"四、楚公子申帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"五、於越入吳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"六、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"七、晉魏曼多帥師侵衞。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"八、葬許元公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"九、九月，螽。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"十、冬，十有一月，有星孛於東方。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"十一、盜殺陳夏區夫。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_241_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_241","textTraditional":"十二、十有二月，螽。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}